# Jekyll build output and local caches under docs/ — never part of the
# published site, regenerated by `bundle exec jekyll build`/`jekyll serve`.
docs/_site/
docs/.sass-cache/
docs/.jekyll-cache/
docs/.jekyll-metadata

# docs/ doesn't pin Gemfile.lock (CI runs bundler-cache: true against the
# Gemfile only); don't let a local `bundle install` add one out of band.
docs/Gemfile.lock

# Hugo build output and local caches under site/ (issue #60). The Hugo site is
# built into ../_site_hugo by CI and into ../_site at cutover; neither is
# committed. `resources/` is Hugo's generated asset cache.
_site_hugo/
site/public/
site/resources/
site/.hugo_build.lock

# Staged from docs/_data/*.yml immediately before `hugo` runs (CI: "Sync
# release-matrix data" in docs-hugo.yml; local dev: see site/README.md).
# docs/_data/ stays the one committed copy so xcp-build-agent's automated
# updates need to know about only one location.
site/data/

# Local preview build (site/README.md, "Build it locally").
_preview/
